1
00:00:01,167 --> 00:00:06,625
Ladies, gentlemen… and assorted mammals. Maison Bouledogue!

2
00:00:08,417 --> 00:00:12,542
Pipette! The heels! Higher! Couture is pain!

3
00:00:12,583 --> 00:00:15,792
Any higher, Monsieur, and she will need oxygen.

4
00:00:15,833 --> 00:00:19,000
Then give her oxygen… in pearls!

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,125
Look one. Flamingo, in… Vertigo.

6
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:33,000
Look two. Giraffe, in forty feet of pearls.

7
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:38,333
No. No no no no.

8
00:00:45,667 --> 00:00:47,667
Oh… oh my.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,458
Of course. It was… intentional.

10
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,375
Of course, Monsieur.
